error[E0441]: 'x' may be used before it is assigned
 --> $DIR/last-read-before-assignment.nra:7:12
  |
3 |     last x: int;
  |          - declared here without a value
4 |     if (flag) {
  |         ---- 'x' is not assigned when this condition is false
...
7 |     return x;
  |            ^ used here, but 'x' is not assigned on every path to it
  |
  = help: assign 'x' exactly once before this use

